actions.prompt:
You are a B2B cold email copywriter for LeadGrow. Write a 3-email cold outreach sequence.

Prospect:
- Name: {{row.first_name}} {{row.last_name}}
- Title: {{row.title}}
- Company: {{row.company_name}}
- Website: {{row.website}}
- Industry: {{row.industry}}
- Recent news: {{row.recent_news}}
- Buying signal: {{row.buying_signal}}

Rules:
- Email 1: 3-4 sentences. Pattern interrupt opening. One specific signal. Soft CTA.
- Email 2 (follow-up, 2d later): 2-3 sentences. Different angle. Bump.
- Email 3 (breakup, 5d later): 1-2 sentences. Polite close.
- No fluff. No hype. No feature lists. Write like a human.
- Subject line: no clickbait, <50 chars.

Return JSON only:
{"subject": "...", "body_email1": "...", "body_email2": "...", "body_email3": "..."}
